# Build the elf rogue fixture elf-rogue-bluff-seed1-opt0822 and save it in the dungeon.
# tools/check_align_treachery_play.sh loads it. Skill ranks are spent so that Bluff
# outranks Diplomacy and Intimidate does not (Creature::Request offers "Use Bluff?" only then).
# Ends with Save and Continue, never @quit; see tools/keys/lizardfolk-monk-save.keys.

a
n
y
@choose "Elf"
@choose "Elf (Standard)"
@choose "Rogue"
a
@choose "Neutral"
a
a

@expect "Unspent Skill Ranks"
@cursorto:mark "Bluff" DOWN
RIGHT*3
@cursorto:mark "Listen" DOWN
RIGHT*3
@cursorto:mark "Lockpicking" DOWN
RIGHT*3
@cursorto:mark "Move Silently" DOWN
RIGHT*3
@cursorto:mark "Perform" DOWN
RIGHT*3
@cursorto:mark "Pick Pockets" DOWN
RIGHT*3
@cursorto:mark "Poison Use" DOWN
RIGHT*3
@cursorto:mark "Ride" DOWN
RIGHT*3
@cursorto:mark "Spot" DOWN
RIGHT*3
ENTER y

y
a

.*2
@dump:arrival
ESC
@expect "System Menu"
b
@dump:saved
